    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n278" root="اجر" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجِيرٌ</span></b>  (S, K, &amp;c.) <i>A hired man; a hireling:</i>
(L:) or of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعِيلٌ</span> in the sense of the
measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفَاعَلٌ</span>, i. e. <i>a man with whom one has
engaged to give him hire, pay,</i> or <i>wages:</i> (Mgh,
Msb: *) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُجَرَآءُ</span>. (L, Msb.)

